\description{
Constrained ordination of samples from their distances, like \code{\link[=dbrda]{dbrda()}},
but of the principal coordinates with positive eigenvalues only. Gives
the same results as \code{vegan::capscale()} (and so as
\code{phyloseq::ordinate(method = "CAP")}). For Euclidean distances it gives
